# Development symlinks (not needed in repo).
# ANCHORED with a leading slash: unanchored, `kabel` matches any directory
# component with that name, so src-kabel/datahike/kabel/ was ignored too and a
# new file there vanished from `git add` without a word. The existing files in
# that directory only survive because they predate the rule.
/distributed-scope
/fress
/kabel
/konserve
/konserve-sync
/persistent-sorted-set
/.agent-shell/

